  "src-tauri (cybermanju-drive) → ALL workspace crates"
]}
{"type": "data_flow_file_lifecycle", "steps": [
  "1. Import: import_file/scan_directory/upload_file commands → file saved to disk + FileNode stored in redb + added to Tantivy index",
  "2. Encryption: encrypt_file command → PqcEngine encrypts with ML-KEM/ML-DSA → FileEncryptedData stored alongside file as .enc.meta.json → FileNode.encrypted=true",
  "3. Compression: compress_file command → TripleCompressor chains LZ4→Zstd→Brotli → CompressionStats reported → original optionally deleted",
  "4. Indexing: add_document to Tantivy → BM25 index built on filename/content/tags → searchable via search_files/suggest",
  "5. Face Detection: detect_faces command → extract face embeddings → cluster via auto-select algorithm → FaceGroup stored in redb → FileNode.face_group_ids updated",
  "6. Sync: start_sync → pipeline (scan→compress→preview→upload→link→clean raw) → FileRelation stored → SyncProgress reported",
  "7. Transfer: transfer_files → copies files between backends (local↔cloud) with progress",
  "8. Portable DB: store_compressed_for_recovery → triple-compressed → stored as .cyb3 blob → RecoveryEntry in redb",
  "9. Trash: delete_file → TrashItem stored → file removed from active listing → restorable",
  "10. Share: generate_share_link → random token → stored in redb → accessible via /api/shared/{token}"
]}
